Package: k-rgb
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: RGB lighting controller for Alienware AW410K keyboard
 Control the RGB LED lighting on Dell Alienware AW410K keyboards.
 Provides a command-line tool and (optionally) a KDE/Qt6 graphical
 application with per-key, per-zone, and case lighting support.
